WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:03.720
AI agents are everywhere right now.

00:04.120 --> 00:07.560
But most AI projects don't fail
because of the AI.

00:08.020 --> 00:10.900
They fail because of the data behind it.

00:10.980 --> 00:14.400
An agent is only as good
as the data you give it.

00:14.500 --> 00:17.300
And that's exactly what I fix.

00:17.920 --> 00:22.040
I'm Lubo, and I've been in this field
for over 15 years.

00:22.900 --> 00:25.380
For 12 years I worked with data,

00:25.740 --> 00:30.680
financial data with SQL first,
then data engineering.

00:30.860 --> 00:35.330
For the last 3+ years, I've been
building AI agents and MCP servers

00:35.380 --> 00:39.300
that connect AI to real business data.

00:40.260 --> 00:43.600
Those years taught me how to take care
of people's data,

00:43.700 --> 00:46.840
and how to ask the right questions.

00:47.600 --> 00:51.120
That's why I start with questions,
not code.

00:51.760 --> 00:56.940
First, I understand your business
and what you really want to get.

00:57.430 --> 01:01.120
Then I pick the technology,
not the other way around.

01:02.360 --> 01:03.700
So why me?

01:04.140 --> 01:08.900
First, I build everything myself,
from start to finish.

01:09.060 --> 01:13.320
The data, the AI,
and the app your team uses.

01:13.880 --> 01:20.400
I built my own AI platform, LuBot.ai,
completely on my own,

01:20.450 --> 01:26.180
and Neon, part of Databricks,
wrote an article about it.

01:26.500 --> 01:29.760
Second, I build AI you can trust.

01:30.000 --> 01:36.240
In my systems, the numbers are calculated
from your real data with real code,

01:36.840 --> 01:39.580
and the AI only explains them.

01:40.220 --> 01:42.300
So it can't make up a number,

01:42.350 --> 01:46.160
and the same question
always gives you the same answer.

01:46.480 --> 01:50.420
And third, I keep your AI bills low.

01:51.020 --> 01:56.740
In one project, 80% of the questions
cost zero in AI fees.

01:58.240 --> 02:00.200
You hire me per project.

02:00.660 --> 02:04.320
A free call, a simple contract
with a written scope,

02:04.900 --> 02:11.300
an update every two weeks, and
everything I build is 100% yours.

02:12.340 --> 02:16.410
So tell me your problem, and I'll
find a way to build a solution.

02:16.460 --> 02:19.700
Book a free call. Talk soon!
